---
// Principles Section: 4 foundational pillars of Renova TMS
---
<section class="principles" id="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="principles-heading">The principles we are building around</h2>
      <p class="intro">
        These are the principles we are building the clinic around. They describe how we intend to care for people, how we measure what we do, and how we work with others.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="principles-synthesis">
      <img
        src="/images/principles/quadrant-synthesis-matrix.webp"
        alt="Abstract four-quadrant synthesis matrix artwork harmonising individualised targeting, empirical measurement, multidisciplinary care, and clinical transparency"
        width="1376"
        height="768"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="grid4">
      <div class="tile">
        <div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7">
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5" />
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.5" />
            <path d="M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Targeted</h3>
        <p>
          Individualised targeting rather than one size fits all, with treatment parameters set for each person and reassessed as treatment progresses.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M3 3v18h18" />
            <path d="M7 16l4-5 4 3 5-7" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Measured</h3>
        <p>
          Progress tracked with validated clinical rating scales, so decisions are guided by real response rather than assumption.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7">
            <circle cx="9" cy="12" r="6" />
            <circle cx="15" cy="12" r="6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Integrated</h3>
        <p>
          Collaborative care with each person&rsquo;s general practitioner, referring psychiatrist and other treating clinicians.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="tile">
        <div class="ic" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M2 12s3.6-6.5 10-6.5S22 12 22 12s-3.6 6.5-10 6.5S2 12 2 12z" />
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Transparent</h3>
        <p>
          Clear, honest guidance on suitability, eligibility, funding and risks, before any treatment is considered.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
